    {
      "text": "Forest plot of sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals for 12 studies of LC-aNAATs for pulmonary TB in people living with HIV (2 Truenat MTB Plus, 10 Xpert Ultra). Sensitivity ranges from 0.54 (Mukoka 2023) to 1.00 and specificity from 0.78 to 1.00.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
